“There is one advantage about this horrid place,” he said;
“we have got it all to ourselves. Stay where you are, Betteredge; I have
something to say to you.”

“She always thought kindly of me, poor soul,” I said;
“and, to the best of my ability, I always tried to act kindly by
her.”

“We can go round by the coast, Mr. Franklin,” said Betteredge;
“and get to the quicksand in that way with plenty of time to spare. What
do you say, sir?”

“If you had spoken when you ought to have spoken,” I began;
“if you had done me the common justice to explain
yourself——”
